  "body": [
    "Home",
    "Valtech Enterprise AI Foundations",
    "Stop leaving value trapped in silos. Build the connected foundation that scales AI across every operation, experience and decision.",
    "Most enterprises are investing in AI. Few are scaling real impact.",
    "AI initiatives are launched across teams, tools and functions, but they rarely connect. Data is duplicated. Context is incomplete. Governance is inconsistent. Pilots succeed in isolation but fail to scale.",
    "The result? Intelligence accumulates, but value stays trapped.",
    "Enterprise AI Foundations is designed to change that. It helps you identify where AI is creating friction instead of value and builds the foundation to turn fragmented initiatives into a connected, scalable system that drives measurable business outcomes.",
    "AI adoption is high. AI coordination and value realization are not.",
    "of AI pilots don’t achieve expected ROI (IDC)",
    "of AI initiatives scale to production (Gartner)",
    "of enterprises cite governance, risk and compliance as major blockers to scaling AI (IDC)",
    "Clear visibility on where AI value is trapped Identify the experience, workflow, and decision points where AI is underperforming or failing to scale.",
    "Identify the experience, workflow, and decision points where AI is underperforming or failing to scale.",
    "A prioritized AI orchestration roadmap A sequenced plan focused on high-impact opportunities tied directly to measurable business outcomes.",
    "A sequenced plan focused on high-impact opportunities tied directly to measurable business outcomes.",
    "A realistic view of your readiness Clarity on your architecture, data, governance, and operating model; what’s ready today and what needs to evolve.",
    "Clarity on your architecture, data, governance, and operating model; what’s ready today and what needs to evolve.",
    "A clear path from pilots to scale A structured approach to turn isolated AI successes into repeatable, enterprise-wide capabilities.",
    "A structured approach to turn isolated AI successes into repeatable, enterprise-wide capabilities.",
    "Enterprise AI Foundations is designed to move AI from experimentation to enterprise value.",
    "Lower operational costs by reducing duplication and inefficiencies",
    "Faster time-to-value by scaling what works—not restarting every time",
    "Increased revenue through experience-driven AI activation",
    "Improved trust through consistent governance and data integrity",
    "Better decision-making with connected, real-time intelligence",
    "We focus on the moments where AI must deliver real impact across your business:",
    "Connecting fragmented data and context across systems",
    "Orchestrating workflows across teams and platforms",
    "Scaling high-value use cases across the enterprise",
    "Embedding governance, trust, and observability into AI",
    "Aligning AI to the experiences that drive growth",
    "Enterprise AI Foundations follows a structured path from insight to scale:",
    "Start with the experience moments that drive business value",
    "Identify where AI is creating friction or failing to scale",
    "Assess architecture, data and governance readiness",
    "Define a clear, prioritized roadmap tied to outcomes",
    "Activate a production-ready use case to prove value quickly",
    "Scale into a repeatable enterprise capability",
    "Most AI initiatives fail because they focus on tools instead of outcomes. This approach ensures AI delivers measurable impact from day one: .",
    "Experience-first, not technology-first",
    "Focused on value. Not experimentation",
    "Built for scale. Not isolated pilots",
    "Designed for flexibility. Not vendor lock-in",
    "Aligned across business, data and technology teams",
    "You don’t need more AI pilots. You need a system that makes them work together.",
    "Enterprise AI Foundations helps you move from fragmented experimentation to scalable impact fast.",
    "Book a session",
    "What is the Enterprise AI Foundations? It’s a structured approach to identify where AI value is trapped and build the foundation to scale AI across your enterprise.",
    "It’s a structured approach to identify where AI value is trapped and build the foundation to scale AI across your enterprise.",
    "How is this different from an AI strategy project? It goes beyond strategy. It connects architecture, data, governance and execution to deliver production-ready outcomes.",
    "It goes beyond strategy. It connects architecture, data, governance and execution to deliver production-ready outcomes.",
    "Do we need an existing AI program? No. It works whether you're starting or scaling, helping define where to focus and how to move forward.",
    "No. It works whether you're starting or scaling, helping define where to focus and how to move forward.",
    "How does this help scale AI It identifies high-impact use cases and builds the foundation to operationalize and repeat them across the organization.",
    "It identifies high-impact use cases and builds the foundation to operationalize and repeat them across the organization.",
    "What if our data isn’t ready? We work with your current environment, identifying what can be used today and what needs to evolve.",
    "We work with your current environment, identifying what can be used today and what needs to evolve.",
    "How quickly can we see value? Through thin-slice activation, we focus on delivering measurable outcomes in weeks, not months.",
    "Through thin-slice activation, we focus on delivering measurable outcomes in weeks, not months."
